    "Scan of the 1968 edition of the Waldenburg, Michigan, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1952; aerial photographs from 1978; field checked in 1968; photo revised in 1980; last revised in 1980; printed in 1981.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 26.9 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
